OL,3,GNEWSASeven dead after police vehicle
OL,4,Aand car crash during pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people including two police
OL,7,Fofficers have been killed in a crash
OL,8,Fduring a pursuit with a "suspicious"
OL,9,Fcar driving the wrong way down a
OL,10,Fdual-carriageway.
OL,12,FThe collision involved a marked police
OL,13,Fvehicle and a Volkswagen Passat on the
OL,14,FA66 in South Bank, near Middlesbrough
OL,15,Fin Teesside, at about 03:39 BST,
OL,16,FCleveland Police said.
OL,18,FThe police car was travelling the right
OL,19,Fway down the road before the crash,
OL,20,Fwith the occupants of both vehicles
OL,21,Fwere pronounced dead at the scene, the
OL,22,Fforce said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
