OL,3,GNEWSASeven dead after police vehicle
OL,4,Aand car crash during pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Constable Victoria Fuller said:
OL,7,F"No one should leave their home and not
OL,8,Freturn safely, including police
OL,9,Fofficers serving their communities and
OL,10,Fprotecting the people of Cleveland."
